    <Observation_Area>
        <comment>
            This data file was migrated from the original PDS3 file:
                COVIMS_0077/data/2015315T092754_2015316T130417/v1825945979_9.qub
            The contents of this data file were reorganized in order to make it
            PDS4 compliant. Sideplanes and backplanes were removed from the cube
            itself and appended at the end of the file as separate arrays. The
            resulting data file remains compatible with ISIS2 standards. Values
            for instrument attributes were derived from the corresponding values
            in the original PDS3 label.

            Note: The PDS3 volumes also contained an earlier version of this file:
                COVIMS_0077/data/2015315T092754_2015316T130417/v1825945979_4.qub
            Only the final version has been migrated to this PDS4 bundle.
        </comment>
